# Toph, the First Metalbender's static ability lasts only while he is on the battlefield (CR 611.3a, 613): Bot1's Mox Emerald is an
# artifact land while he is there, and a plain artifact again once Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills him. The Mox earthbent at the end step
# of turn 1 stays a creature (its earthbend is its own effect), but is no longer a land.

